 "text": "Hi, how are things with you? Good that you asked. A simple yet heartfelt note along with a run friendly tank top and water bottle are great basics. Then a light layer that wicks sweat and keeps the cold off is ideal. A thin base layer also helps dry her face. A tough runner watch would be good, waterproof for rain and scratch proof so it lasts. If budget's tight, a simple timer watch does trick. A small bag of hand sanitizer too. She'll appreciate clean hands at the office after each run.",
